cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "kelpPR: code and data for kelp aquaculture metagenome proteorhodopsin analysis"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-26"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23717547"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/figooooooo/kelpPR-metagenome-PR"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and processed data for the metagenomic study of kelp (Saccharina japonica)
  farming effects on bacterioplankton community structure and proteorhodopsin-based phototrophy
  in Dongshan Bay, China (six surface-water metagenomes, three kelp-farming versus three control
  stations, January 2025).
keywords:
  - proteorhodopsin
  - metagenomics
  - kelp aquaculture
  - bacterioplankton
  - metagenome-assembled genomes
  - Dongshan Bay
authors:
